WEBVTT

00:03.890 --> 00:06.030
This is your last bonus.

00:06.030 --> 00:09.400
Aki-sama's birthday is the 24th of this month.

00:09.400 --> 00:11.490
Christmas Eve!

00:11.770 --> 00:13.880
She'll be really happy if 
you celebrate it with her.

00:13.880 --> 00:17.950
I see! Thank you, Master! No, my goddess!

00:23.840 --> 00:24.990
Also...

00:25.800 --> 00:27.690
I'm going to stop making contact

00:29.080 --> 00:30.430
with you like this.

00:35.830 --> 00:36.630
Huh?

02:14.020 --> 02:19.990
<b>#6 "Our Second Date"</b>

02:14.690 --> 02:16.490
My birfdayth?

02:16.490 --> 02:21.950
I was born in January, 
but I was wondering when you were born.

02:21.950 --> 02:23.990
Huh... When do you think it is?

02:23.990 --> 02:29.330
Uh... I dunno. I'm not really 
good at guessing. Maybe summer?

02:29.710 --> 02:32.920
Well, you're way off. It's December 24th.

02:34.310 --> 02:38.170
<i>She's so cute when she makes faces 
like that. Just like when we were kids.</i>

02:38.850 --> 02:41.320
Huh... So you were born on Christmas Eve.

02:41.320 --> 02:43.640
Let me celebrate that day with you, then.

02:44.680 --> 02:47.660
That's not a bad proposal 
coming from you for once.

02:49.520 --> 02:53.820
<i>Is that an okay? Yes! I did it, Master!</i>

02:53.820 --> 02:56.520
Aki-sama, here's your extra mochi.

02:58.440 --> 03:03.580
<i>Right. That was the agreement. 
She's so thorough.</i>

03:06.400 --> 03:10.590
<i>Anyway, I can't get any more help from Master.</i>

03:10.590 --> 03:13.250
<i>I'll have to think up these 
Christmas plans myself.</i>

03:13.250 --> 03:17.210
<b><b>Here's Our
Recommended
Christmas Course!</b></b>

03:13.250 --> 03:17.210
<b>Cute Christmas Fashion
and Accessories ♥</b>

03:13.250 --> 03:17.210
<b>Our Best Christmas Date
Report!!</b>

03:13.920 --> 03:16.680
<i>But there are just too many options...</i>

03:17.700 --> 03:19.480
S-Say, Chinatsu.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.330
Hm?

03:20.330 --> 03:23.230
If you were going on a Christmas 
date, what would you like to do?

03:23.230 --> 03:27.390
A Christmas date? 
Why, go to a castle, of course!

03:27.390 --> 03:28.180
What?

03:28.180 --> 03:32.900
I'd rent out a whole castle, 
cosplay as a princess, and dance!

03:32.900 --> 03:36.080
I'm talking about something 
rooted in reality here.

03:36.080 --> 03:38.250
Oh. Then I guess I could 
compromise and settle for

03:38.250 --> 03:40.250
dinner at a hotel with an ocean view.

03:40.250 --> 03:43.020
You middle school girls sure expect a lot.

03:43.020 --> 03:45.370
What's this? Are you talking about dates?

03:45.370 --> 03:49.950
Mom! You've had a Christmas 
dinner with Dad before, right?

03:49.950 --> 03:52.730
I have! But it was so troublesome

03:52.730 --> 03:55.740
because they accidentally 
brought out a kids' lunch for me.

03:55.740 --> 03:56.700
What the heck?

03:56.700 --> 03:59.000
And then they brought out Hamburg steak.

03:59.000 --> 03:59.440
Yeah?

03:59.240 --> 04:02.760
Yeah, my bad for even 
asking you two in the first place.

03:59.440 --> 04:00.880
I couldn't eat all of it.

04:00.880 --> 04:01.630
Did you, though?

04:01.630 --> 04:04.260
Yeah. My stomach was so full.

04:06.040 --> 04:08.010
Oh. Hey, by the way, Onii-chan.

04:08.010 --> 04:10.360
Since we're talking about Christmas,

04:10.360 --> 04:14.230
Mom did a lottery in the 
shopping district today and...

04:18.720 --> 04:19.900
When all else fails...

04:20.240 --> 04:24.820
<i>I'll have to rely on the bible of a million girls, 
as well as my own... </i>Rose-eyed Steroid<i>!</i>

04:22.860 --> 04:24.820
<b>Rose-eyed Steroid</b>

04:22.860 --> 04:24.820
<b>Hanano Rabuko</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
<b>Vvoooorrrr</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
<b>m 0 0 l 20 0 l 20 68 l 0 68</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
<b>m 0 0 l 34 0 l 34 110 l 0 110</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
<b>m 0 0 l 34 0 l 34 110 l 0 110</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
<b>m 0 0 l 34 0 l 34 110 l 0 110</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
That's
fine,

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
because
you're
safe.

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
...
was
ruined.

04:37.000 --> 04:41.740
Christmases in 2D are so overshadowed by 
other incidents that it's not Christmas at all!

04:49.710 --> 04:52.410
Maybe I should just buy some new outfits.

04:52.820 --> 04:53.810
What do you think?

04:56.880 --> 05:00.010
I'm sure you'd look amazing 
in any of them, Aki-sama.

05:00.690 --> 05:03.650
A perfect place for a Christmas date?

05:03.650 --> 05:05.600
Shh! Not so loud!

05:05.600 --> 05:09.310
S-Sorry. Is this for you and Adagaki-san?

05:09.310 --> 05:10.300
Yeah...

05:10.300 --> 05:12.860
Aw, that sounds like fun.

05:12.860 --> 05:16.270
I've been researching a lot, 
but nothing's really speaking to me.

05:16.270 --> 05:19.660
Well, I know plenty of 
exceptional restaurants.

05:20.880 --> 05:24.630
<b></b>Italian "Buono"

05:21.910 --> 05:24.630
The fresh pasta at this 
Italian place is amazing,

05:24.630 --> 05:27.470
and this place has great 
super-soft Hamburg steak.

05:27.470 --> 05:30.360
Oh, and you need a reservation 
for the pancakes at this café,

05:30.360 --> 05:33.740
but they're super yummy! 
You have to try them once before you die!

05:33.740 --> 05:35.160
R-Right...

06:12.350 --> 06:13.740
Welcome.

06:12.650 --> 06:14.310
Thank you very much.

06:20.090 --> 06:21.980
Just five more minutes...

06:24.210 --> 06:25.800
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:34.470 --> 06:35.480
What?

06:35.480 --> 06:39.440
Oh, just... I guess you really did decide 
against cosplaying as Hada Pure.

06:39.440 --> 06:42.280
Th-That was just Yoshino's mistake!

06:42.280 --> 06:44.410
I know. You told me before.

06:44.410 --> 06:48.090
Just forget about it already! 
Right this second! Sooner, if you can!

06:48.960 --> 06:51.900
So, what are we going to do today?

06:55.840 --> 06:58.600
I couldn't think of anything too creative,

06:58.600 --> 07:00.950
so sorry it's a rehash of last time, but...

07:00.950 --> 07:02.270
No zombies?

07:02.270 --> 07:03.770
No zombies.

07:04.370 --> 07:06.440
Well, okay, then.

07:06.830 --> 07:09.310
Sorry, but I didn't rent out the whole theater.

07:09.310 --> 07:11.020
I guess I can't expect too much.

07:14.250 --> 07:15.200
Hey.

07:15.200 --> 07:16.740
You're too close.

07:17.050 --> 07:20.420
<i>I bought one extra seat to 
the side again, just in case,</i>

07:20.910 --> 07:22.710
<i>but I doubt it'll be any different...</i>

07:26.360 --> 07:30.760
I mean, I'm not going to tell you 
not to sit next to me if we're dating.

07:37.890 --> 07:40.390
<i>Pochi! Come here!</i>

07:42.710 --> 07:44.830
<i>I can't even concentrate...</i>

07:44.830 --> 07:47.640
<i>The smell of popcorn and 
the actors' cheesy lines</i>

07:47.640 --> 07:49.830
<i>are messing with my brain.</i>

07:53.000 --> 07:55.570
<i>But I should try not to forget...</i>

07:56.800 --> 08:01.830
<i>that the feelings we feel right 
now actually made us happy.</i>

08:01.830 --> 08:03.430
<i>They weren't a lie.</i>

08:09.840 --> 08:10.860
Yoshino.

08:11.710 --> 08:14.460
It's Christmas. Why do you look so gloomy?

08:14.950 --> 08:17.900
I don't. And Christmas doesn't concern me.

08:17.900 --> 08:19.750
Well, I guess you're right.

08:19.750 --> 08:20.550
Here.

08:24.400 --> 08:25.270
What's this?

08:25.580 --> 08:28.980
Work, you dummy. Well, see you later.

08:35.570 --> 08:37.780
Th-That wasn't fair...

08:38.360 --> 08:40.890
I let my guard down because 
you said there were no zombies,

08:40.890 --> 08:43.810
but it was a story about 
an old man and animals.

08:43.810 --> 08:44.910
I just...

08:44.910 --> 08:47.770
<i>This time, she's crying because 
she was moved to tears.</i>

08:47.770 --> 08:51.550
Okay, okay. Just calm down. 
I have reservations at a café nearby.

08:51.930 --> 08:53.140
A café?

08:58.080 --> 08:59.440
What's it like?

08:59.440 --> 09:01.550
I guess they serve pancakes.

09:01.550 --> 09:05.290
The Sweets General recommended 
it to me, so it should be good.

09:07.030 --> 09:09.070
It should be around here somewhere...

09:09.070 --> 09:11.760
It's on the second floor 
of a building with a roof.

09:11.760 --> 09:13.980
Could it be that place?

09:16.450 --> 09:17.500
What?!

09:19.520 --> 09:21.640
Um... Is everything oka—

09:21.640 --> 09:24.830
My shop!

09:24.830 --> 09:28.250
Oh... That fire this morning 
must've been at this café.

09:28.250 --> 09:30.620
I guess so. It was really good, too.

09:30.620 --> 09:32.040
Poor guy.

09:35.630 --> 09:39.210
I guess I now belong in 
the 2D world of incidents.

09:40.110 --> 09:42.840
W-We'll just have to go somewhere else.

09:42.840 --> 09:44.180
Yeah.

09:44.510 --> 09:45.930
I'm very sorry.

09:45.930 --> 09:46.940
We are currently...

09:47.440 --> 09:49.230
We apologize for the wait.

09:49.830 --> 09:52.230
Curse you, Christmas...

09:52.230 --> 09:55.500
It's fine. This is just a 
bad time to go anywhere.

09:55.500 --> 09:57.280
We can give up for today, and—

09:57.280 --> 09:58.460
No, Adagaki-san!

09:58.460 --> 10:00.620
We mustn't give up so easily!

10:00.620 --> 10:04.000
Do you have any idea just how 
much research I did for this day?

10:04.000 --> 10:08.620
So for you to tell me give up so easily... 
I can't let that slide, even if it's you!

10:08.620 --> 10:10.030
Do you understand?!

10:10.030 --> 10:12.600
O-Okay, fine. Jeez.

10:12.600 --> 10:14.380
What are we going to do, then?

10:15.840 --> 10:19.800
<i>Somewhere else that's nearby, 
where we can eat and rest...</i>

10:23.380 --> 10:24.940
Want to come over to my place?

10:31.730 --> 10:35.000
Are you sure your family 
will be okay with this?

10:35.000 --> 10:38.300
Yeah, it's fine. I'm sure they'll 
welcome you with open arms.

10:38.300 --> 10:41.950
<i>Just like when Master and 
Fujinomiya-san came over...</i>

10:41.950 --> 10:45.880
Go on, eat up. We've got 
chicken and cake ready for you.

10:45.880 --> 10:47.950
What?! Onii-chan finally lucked out?!

10:49.590 --> 10:52.710
Actually, they might be a bit annoying...

10:52.710 --> 10:55.100
M-Maybe it'll be okay...

10:56.660 --> 10:59.740
It's fine. We're already here, 
so I'll accept your invitation.

11:00.570 --> 11:05.100
They might make a big fuss 
at first... but they won't bite.

11:05.100 --> 11:07.320
Do you have a ferocious dog or something?

11:07.320 --> 11:08.680
I'm home!

11:11.060 --> 11:12.150
Huh?

11:12.680 --> 11:14.500
H-Hang on one second.

11:19.820 --> 11:23.750
<i>Wait, no one's here. That can't be right...</i>

11:25.990 --> 11:28.970
<i>I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!</i>

11:25.990 --> 11:36.460
<b>I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!
It's the thing Mom won in the lottery!
~Chinatsu~</b>

11:25.990 --> 11:36.460
<b>Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.
Too bad we all couldn't go together.
-Mom-</b>

11:28.970 --> 11:31.540
<i>It's the thing Mom won in the lottery!</i>

11:32.000 --> 11:34.120
<i>Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.</i>

11:34.120 --> 11:36.460
<i>Too bad we all couldn't go together.</i>

11:36.780 --> 11:39.500
<i>I-I didn't hear anything about this!</i>

11:39.970 --> 11:42.280
Since we're talking about Christmas,

11:42.280 --> 11:45.890
Mom did a lottery in the 
shopping district today and...

11:45.890 --> 11:49.070
<i>That's what she meant!</i>

11:49.070 --> 11:51.350
Um, Makabe?

11:51.800 --> 11:54.220
Is your family not home?

11:54.220 --> 11:57.080
Um, uh, well...

11:59.820 --> 12:01.020
What's this?

12:05.600 --> 12:06.740
This means...

12:07.440 --> 12:12.520
<i>Basically, this means we're 
completely alone together!</i>

12:15.500 --> 12:17.190
Joyeux Noel.

12:27.730 --> 12:29.390
So yummy!

12:31.630 --> 12:34.890
To think that I get to spend Christmas 
with my adorable little sister...

12:34.890 --> 12:37.520
I'm so blessed!

12:37.520 --> 12:40.970
Stop being so dramatic. 
You're embarrassing me.

12:46.530 --> 12:48.440
Here. Your present.

12:51.570 --> 12:52.450
This is...

12:52.450 --> 12:56.710
I'm happy that I get to spend 
Christmas with you, too.

12:57.100 --> 13:01.960
M-Muriel... I'm so glad to be alive!

13:02.850 --> 13:05.920
Oh, and here's a list of circles 
I want you to visit.

13:05.920 --> 13:07.930
This one's super popular right now.

13:07.930 --> 13:08.840
Huh?

13:08.840 --> 13:11.210
You're going to Japon again at 
the end of the year, aren't you?

13:11.210 --> 13:13.350
S-So what you're saying is...

13:13.350 --> 13:18.360
Will you go to the huge year-end 
doujinshi event for me?

13:20.840 --> 13:23.760
Of course I will! 
Leave this to your big brother!

13:23.760 --> 13:25.530
Yay!

13:25.530 --> 13:27.490
<b>I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!
It's the thing Mom won in the lottery!
~Chinatsu~</b>

13:25.530 --> 13:27.490
<b>Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.
Too bad we all couldn't go together.
-Mom-</b>

13:30.730 --> 13:34.870
<i>Is this some kind of trap?! 
Did I just leap into a wolf's den?</i>

13:34.870 --> 13:38.830
<i>Does she think I did this on purpose? 
No! This is a misunderstanding!</i>

13:40.720 --> 13:41.900
Um—

13:44.340 --> 13:49.550
<i>C-Calm down. You'll be finished if 
you panic and show him weakness.</i>

13:50.030 --> 13:53.770
<i>Don't be hasty! You won't be convincing 
at all if you're acting suspicious!</i>

13:54.630 --> 13:58.230
W-Well, I guess if they 
aren't here, they aren't here.

13:58.760 --> 14:01.900
I mean, we just stopped by to have some tea.

14:01.900 --> 14:03.690
This is no problem at all.

14:04.200 --> 14:08.360
Or what? Did you have 
some ulterior motive in mind?

14:08.360 --> 14:10.660
L-Like hell I did!

14:11.520 --> 14:15.580
In that case, Makabe Masamune-kun, 
could I have some tea, please?

14:15.580 --> 14:17.080
Yeah, yeah.

14:21.590 --> 14:24.840
<i>Damn it! I feel like I lost somehow!</i>

14:25.440 --> 14:28.390
Anyway, tea. Where are the tea leaves?

14:30.160 --> 14:31.710
Maa-kun, do you want some snacks?

14:31.710 --> 14:33.070
Want some roll cake?

14:33.070 --> 14:35.520
I made a parfait! Want some?

14:38.150 --> 14:40.690
<i>Are there only snacks in this whole household?</i>

14:40.690 --> 14:43.960
Tea leaves, please! 
I will even accept tea bags!

14:43.960 --> 14:47.470
Hey. Can't you even make tea quietly?

14:47.470 --> 14:50.160
Oh, er... I was just looking for the tea.

14:50.160 --> 14:54.650
And you can't find it. I figured as much.

14:54.650 --> 14:56.970
Whatever. You can just get some cups out.

14:56.970 --> 14:59.160
I'll help you look for the tea.

14:59.160 --> 15:00.140
Sorry...

15:04.880 --> 15:08.380
<i>Huh... I guess she can be pretty nice.</i>

15:09.290 --> 15:10.520
Say, Makabe.

15:10.520 --> 15:11.450
Yeah?

15:11.450 --> 15:14.970
We were supposed to eat pancakes today, right?

15:15.140 --> 15:17.680
<b>For Meals or Dessert!
Fluffy and Delicious!</b>

15:15.140 --> 15:17.680
<b>You can make
them with water</b>

15:17.680 --> 15:21.850
1. Mix eggs and milk in a bowl.
Next, pour in the pancake mix and
stir well.

2. Make sure the frying pan is heated.
Put in a little bit of oil, and then
pour in the batter.

3. Fry them on low heat for 3 minutes,
flip them over, and fry them
for another 2 minutes.

15:18.440 --> 15:21.850
First we add the powder to some milk and eggs...

15:22.200 --> 15:24.090
I found them both in your fridge.

15:24.090 --> 15:28.610
Once the batter is mixed, you just fry 
them in the frying pan... apparently.

15:34.990 --> 15:38.060
That side's done. Better flip it over now.

15:38.060 --> 15:40.250
All right... Hup!

15:43.430 --> 15:45.500
Adagaki-san...

15:45.500 --> 15:47.960
Oh, you're so helpless.

15:51.400 --> 15:52.220
Hup!

15:55.490 --> 15:57.060
Makabe...

15:58.200 --> 16:01.020
Well... we managed to make some.

16:01.020 --> 16:03.150
We never did find the tea, though.

16:03.150 --> 16:05.860
Well, we found a can of 
hot cocoa, so it's fine.

16:06.370 --> 16:07.310
Let's eat.

16:07.310 --> 16:09.480
<i>I honestly wanted sugar-free...</i>

16:22.980 --> 16:26.590
Hot cocoa and pancakes... Not bad.

16:26.590 --> 16:28.920
<i>But she seems happy, so it's fine.</i>

16:29.720 --> 16:31.510
Here. Open wide.

16:34.600 --> 16:37.300
Oh? What's wrong? Did that get to you?

16:37.640 --> 16:39.630
This is nothing, right?

16:39.630 --> 16:41.920
You're still mad about earlier?

16:41.920 --> 16:43.730
I don't know. Am I?

16:44.110 --> 16:48.970
Everyone always says I'm sadistic, 
but you're far more sadistic than me.

16:55.000 --> 16:58.200
<i>I felt something weird there just now.</i>

16:58.520 --> 17:00.640
The flavor's definitely lacking something.

17:00.640 --> 17:02.700
You didn't add enough toppings!

17:04.210 --> 17:07.050
Huh? Hey, wait!

17:08.130 --> 17:10.210
This is way too much...

17:10.650 --> 17:13.820
Why? I think it's suitable for you.

17:16.390 --> 17:17.910
<i>Suitable for me?</i>

17:18.430 --> 17:21.030
<i>What the heck do you know about me?</i>

17:21.030 --> 17:22.640
Oh, that's right.

17:23.220 --> 17:25.350
I saw vanilla ice cream in the freezer—

17:26.070 --> 17:27.160
Adagaki-san.

17:29.300 --> 17:30.680
Come with me for a sec.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.540
Wha—

17:32.880 --> 17:35.530
What's with you all of a sudden, Makabe?!

17:38.870 --> 17:40.830
This is my room.

17:50.690 --> 17:51.500
That, too.

18:01.330 --> 18:02.310
No way...

18:04.390 --> 18:06.230
You still had this?

18:07.190 --> 18:08.540
<i>No...</i>

18:08.540 --> 18:11.820
No! That's not the point, Aki-chan!

18:12.520 --> 18:14.110
Masamune?

18:14.110 --> 18:18.220
It's true that I'm the fat little Masamune 
you knew eight years ago.

18:18.220 --> 18:21.960
But I wanted to change from that, 
and that's how I became who I am now.

18:21.960 --> 18:25.620
So it's a bit hard for me when someone 
wants me to go back to that.

18:26.610 --> 18:31.920
<i>Even if it was all a misunderstanding, 
I can't imagine wanting to be my old self.</i>

18:31.920 --> 18:33.670
W-Wait...

18:35.240 --> 18:39.180
Am I worthless... the way I am now?

18:40.050 --> 18:41.190
Wai—

18:43.760 --> 18:44.920
Ow...

18:51.560 --> 18:53.150
I...

19:00.180 --> 19:01.320
Makabe?

19:02.550 --> 19:03.320
Sorry!

19:03.770 --> 19:04.830
Excuse me a sec.

19:08.470 --> 19:09.510
<i>What?</i>

19:15.560 --> 19:18.670
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

19:22.710 --> 19:25.310
Where the heck did Makabe go?

19:25.690 --> 19:27.500
Honestly, what's his problem?

19:27.500 --> 19:30.220
First he invites me over, 
and then he just disappears!

19:32.440 --> 19:37.230
Messages

19:32.440 --> 19:37.230
Makabe Masamune

19:32.440 --> 19:37.230
Edit

19:32.520 --> 19:34.730
Okay.

19:32.520 --> 19:34.730
In the 2nd floor
bathroom RN

19:34.730 --> 19:37.230
In the 2nd floor
bathroom RN

19:34.860 --> 19:37.230
My stomach hurts so much,
I can't move

19:39.190 --> 19:43.160
My stomach hurts so much,
I can't move

19:39.190 --> 19:43.160
There's a present for you downstairs
in my coat pocket

19:39.190 --> 19:45.660
Messages

19:39.190 --> 19:45.660
Makabe Masamune

19:39.190 --> 19:45.660
Edit

19:43.160 --> 19:45.660
There's a present for you downstairs
in my coat pocket

19:43.280 --> 19:45.660
Please just take that and
leave for today

19:45.660 --> 19:47.120
<b>I'm really sorry</b>

19:47.240 --> 19:49.870
<b>Also, Happy Birthday</b>

19:52.680 --> 19:54.170
A present?

19:56.150 --> 19:57.540
Is this it?

20:01.050 --> 20:05.430
<i>I'm not sure if I should be grateful that my 
phone was in my butt pocket or not...</i>

20:05.880 --> 20:08.140
<i>But seriously, I'm in so much pain.</i>

20:08.140 --> 20:10.780
<i>Were the loli hag's ingredients 
rotten or something?</i>

20:12.890 --> 20:15.650
Okay.
Take care.

20:12.890 --> 20:15.650
Cruel Princess

20:16.760 --> 20:18.360
<i>No, that's not it.</i>

20:21.480 --> 20:25.620
<i>The last time I had a stomachache, 
I didn't break out in hives like this.</i>

20:26.510 --> 20:27.990
<i>They started appearing when...</i>

20:32.360 --> 20:36.520
<i>I can't touch Adagaki Aki.</i>

20:40.720 --> 20:43.050
Welcome home, Aki-sama.

20:43.550 --> 20:45.260
Why are you dressed like that?

20:45.260 --> 20:48.040
The master is having a Christmas party.

20:48.040 --> 20:50.360
I slipped away from bingo duty.

20:50.360 --> 20:52.620
I see. Well, good work.

20:56.980 --> 20:59.820
Was your date not fun?

20:59.820 --> 21:02.060
Th-That's not true!

21:02.060 --> 21:03.930
That's not true...

21:05.010 --> 21:07.100
That's not true, but...

21:09.990 --> 21:11.660
Say, Yoshino.

21:12.770 --> 21:17.080
Could it be that I have no 
appeal as a woman at all?

21:22.350 --> 21:24.650
You have plenty of appeal, Aki-sama.

21:24.650 --> 21:27.860
No, forget it! Never mind! It's nothing!

21:38.230 --> 21:41.000
They look just like Sean and Lancelot.

21:42.290 --> 21:46.530
Those memories are irreplaceable to me.

21:47.750 --> 21:49.940
Don't you feel the same way?

21:51.000 --> 21:54.000
That's what I thought, at least...

21:58.000 --> 22:00.000
I'm going to get revenge
on that woman!!

22:06.020 --> 22:08.040
<i>What did that mean?</i>
